Z||000003||batboy||03-19-2000||08:54 AM||||In Kansas, after so many years, vehicles are exempt from mileage too, but you can still look at the odometer and read what it says. The guy sounds a little flakey, I admit, but it's still a nice looking GT well worth restoring and probably not a lot of work either. The driver seat back does need some repair if you look closely. It's not perfect, just thought I'd point it out to the Forum... hint, hint.||||reg||1
Z||000004||Monkeyman||03-19-2000||10:03 AM||||In Indiana, "exempt" mileage only means that the odometer has run out of numbers.  (i.e. it's over 100,000 on most cars.)||||reg||1
